      <p begin="01:23.750" end="01:26.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Hop up in the Lamb' and drop the roof, show the tits (Offset)</p>
      <p begin="01:26.500" end="01:28.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Told my fam', I got the gang with me (gang with me)</p>
      <p begin="01:28.620" end="01:31.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Bought my first Patek, got some rain on it (Patek)</p>
